      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="features-grid">
        <article class="feature"><h3>Learn by making</h3><p>Project-based classes with practical outcomes and downloadable resources.</p></article>
        <article class="feature"><h3>Structured paths</h3><p>Follow guided learning tracks from beginner basics to pro-level workflows.</p></article>
        <article class="feature"><h3>Creative community</h3><p>Share work, get feedback, and stay inspired by peers and mentors worldwide.</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:1rem;" id="stats">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="stats-band">
        <div><div class="stat-value">425k+</div><div class="stat-label">Members</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-value">30k+</div><div class="stat-label">Classes</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-value">9k+</div><div class="stat-label">Teachers</div></div>
        <div><div class="stat-value">4.8</div><div class="stat-label">App Store Rating</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" id="courses">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <h2>Explore Online Creative Classes</h2>
        <p>Switch categories to instantly discover curated classes across your favorite creative disciplines.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="tabs" role="tablist" aria-label="Course categories tabs">
        <button class="tab active" data-tab="Featured" role="tab" aria-selected="true">Featured</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="Music" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Music</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="Drawing & Painting" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Drawing &amp; Painting</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="Marketing" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Marketing</button>
        <button class="tab" data-tab="Animation" role="tab" aria-selected="false">Animation</button>
