          <article class="teacher"><div class="avatar" style="background:#ff7d5c">DV</div><h3>Diego Vega</h3><p>Digital Designer</p></article>
          <article class="teacher"><div class="avatar" style="background:#55da9b;color:#113125;">KT</div><h3>Kira Tan</h3><p>Animator, Product Designer</p></article>
          <article class="teacher"><div class="avatar" style="background:#1f2745">RA</div><h3>Rosa Ahmed</h3><p>Graphic Designer</p></article>
          <article class="teacher"><div class="avatar" style="background:#efb41a;color:#342501;">MJ</div><h3>Mina Joshi</h3><p>Watercolor Artist</p></article>
          <article class="teacher"><div class="avatar" style="background:#0f9c6a">LP</div><h3>Leo Park</h3><p>Motion Graphics Artist</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;" id="testimonials">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Loved by Learners</h2><p>Real stories from members building creative confidence and professional momentum.</p></div>
      <div class="testimonials">
        <article class="quote"><p>“Joining CreativeHub was the best learning decision I've ever made.”</p><strong>— Maya, Illustrator</strong></article>
        <article class="quote"><p>“Real-world skills without the financial burden of expensive workshops.”</p><strong>— Jordan, Filmmaker</strong></article>
        <article class="quote"><p>“This is one subscription I can't imagine not having in my toolkit.”</p><strong>— Priya, UX Designer</strong></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;" id="teams">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Trusted by Creative Teams</h2><p>Upskill teams with practical classes in design, storytelling, and digital production.</p></div>
      <div class="teams-grid">
        <article class="team-card">Design studio onboarding tracks for junior and mid-level creatives.</article>
        <article class="team-card">Marketing and content teams leveling up visual communication skills.</article>
        <article class="team-card">Product teams learning UI, motion, and brand storytelling workflows.</article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section" style="padding-top:0;" id="faq">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="sec-head"><h2>Frequently Asked Questions</h2><p>Everything you need to know before starting your free trial.</p></div>
      <div class="faq" id="faqList">
        <article class="faq-item open">
          <button class="faq-q">What is CreativeHub? <span>+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>CreativeHub is an online learning platform with thousands of creative classes taught by industry pros.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q">What is included in my membership? <span>+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Your membership unlocks the full class catalog, learning paths, community features, and project feedback tools.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q">What can I learn? <span>+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>You can learn design, illustration, animation, filmmaking, content creation, freelancing, and more.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q">What happens after my trial is over? <span>+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>After 7 days, your paid plan begins automatically unless canceled before the trial ends.</p></div>
        </article>
        <article class="faq-item">
          <button class="faq-q">Can I teach on the platform? <span>+</span></button>
          <div class="faq-a"><p>Yes. Experienced creatives can apply to become teachers and publish classes for the CreativeHub community.</p></div>
